=== 8. Run it again. The first reading is already gone
$ docker run --rm vitals-logger P-001 120 80 72
Saved reading for P-001
File: /data/readings.csv
Readings in file: 1
-> ok

=== 9. Same thing, but keep the container this time
$ docker run --name data-demo vitals-logger P-001 120 80 72
